# plain-debris: the saved game the plain-debris session starts from. A new character, as the
# newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheat
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a scroll of Light (0x134, spell 5: block 6 string
# 0x105, as LOOK.C names it) of quality 1, as a level stores an enchanted scroll, into the
# pack, so that one throw at a wall breaks it. Saved in slot 1, described "debris"
14000 key esc
16500 key esc
20000 key enter        # Create Character
24000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
26000 key enter        # the difficulty
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key enter
36000 key enter
38000 key enter
40000 key a            # the name
40200 key v
40400 key a
40600 key t
40800 key a
41000 key r
42000 key enter
44000 key enter        # Yes
52000 cheat give 0x134 1 1 spell 5
55000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot 1, "debris"
55100 key s
55300 up ctrl
57000 key enter
58500 key d
58700 key e
58900 key b
59100 key r
59300 key i
59500 key s
61500 key enter
